		<h2>We’re a team of developers and data enthusiasts on a mission to make fuel prices transparent and accessible for everyone in Auckland.</h2>
	</div>
</div>
<div class="d-flex justify-content-center mb-5">
	<div class="row">
		<div class="col-sm-4 position-relative mb-3">
			<img src="/images/Dara.png" alt="Dara" class="mx-auto teamImg">
			<h1 class="position-absolute top-0 start-50 translate-middle-x mt-5 name">Dara</h1>
		</div>
		<div class="col-sm-4 position-relative mb-3">
			<img src="/images/Dustin.png" alt="Dustin" class="mx-auto teamImg">
